WEBVTT

00:30:28.871 --> 00:30:30.954
you know, as aggressively announced.

00:30:30.954 --> 00:30:36.454
And time is available for some writers
to be able to actually work on

00:30:36.454 --> 00:30:41.788
the stories in a more, you know, I think
human pace. And that is no small thing.

00:30:41.954 --> 00:30:44.996
Is there creative practice that you've
rethought during the past year?

00:30:46.954 --> 00:30:51.663
If you had said to me that we could be
breaking stories without ever being in

00:30:51.663 --> 00:30:57.663
the same room together, I would have
thought it was probably impossible,

00:30:57.663 --> 00:31:02.996
if not wildly unlikely. And I think
that online, not just the Zoom's,